   "body": "**Grouped work (operator rule, 2026-11-12): claim the group, fix it in one pass.** This issue is one of a group of near-duplicates that touch the same component. **Group R, reader chrome and menus:** #594 (post \"⋯\" menu and its position, GAP-064) · #820 (reader bars: one \"⋯\" at the top, end-of-page buttons) · #821 (reader \"⋯\" menu content) · #641 (first post hidden under the top bar).\n- Whoever claims one claims **every issue of the group**, with the same `/claim <id>` on each, and fixes them in **one PR** that names each (`Closes #N` per issue).\n- The change goes in the one shared reader bar and menu code, as #836 asks.\n- If a member cannot be done in that pass, say why on it and keep it `Refs`.\n- #594 holds a claim `ext/francoisgn-ui-594` of 2026-11-07, silent since. Its holder either extends it to the group or releases it.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
